# Line endings. This repo is developed on Windows with `core.autocrlf=true`,
# which left the working tree mixed (`.ts` files LF, `README.md` CRLF). Prettier
# normalizes to LF (its default, and what git stores anyway), so without this
# `pnpm format:check` fails on Windows checkouts for line endings alone.
# Normalizing here keeps the working tree and the formatter in agreement.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary — never line-ending-converted, never diffed as text.
*.jpg binary
